  m_text: "When the elevator is in operation and the flood detection switch detects
    flooding, the elevator will stop at the nearest floor and the doors will open
    with the announcement \u201C\u51A0\u6C34\u3067\u3059\u3002\u7BA1\u5236\u904B\u8EE2\u3092\u884C\u3044\u307E\u3059\u3002\u201D
    (This means \u201CFlooding detected. Entering emergency operation.\u201D). \nIf
    the nearest floor is the lowest floor, the elevator will move up to the next
    floor and then open the doors."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
